    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d569">

                <pb facs="0555" n="479" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg479"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/17368</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">El Paso</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-03-08T14:00:00-07:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 8, 1916, 2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Villa forces south of Columbus have not been attacked and are not being pursued,
                    according to private admissions in Juarez, because of insufficient troops under
                    Juarez command and failure of detachments from Chihuahua.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cobb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
